onna Mariuccia - Mariuccia polenta e puccia come la chiamavano tutti- nel giorno del suo compleanno si è ricordata di quella volta in cui non è riuscita a entrare nel rifugio e si è dovuta buttare a terra per sperare di non essere colpita dai mitragliatori inglesi. Quante storie incredibili ha da raccontare la nonna Mariuccia che queste 94 candeline, io credo, se le è proprio meritate.", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFc6zI3tfX8gDk69QN0HN4XbnzCIpoEG5uzPUYCFMzVeBV-VdHyQQcpHw3SIFC4hFc&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEwpMSc&_nc_gid=ZBjJfssWPHY0KI1wrmHWUQ&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af84NDi3zY5Ms3BJfQFlBBQEw6LQTDGMBmhv9MAKICn7CQ&oe=6A2632AC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Yesterday was the birthday of Nonna Mariuccia, 94 years old.\nGrandma Mariuccia - Mariuccia polenta and puccia as everyone called her - on her birthday remembered the time she couldn't get into the shelter and had to throw herself to the ground to hope she wouldn't get hit by British machine gunners. How many incredible stories does grandma Mariuccia have to tell that these 94 candles, I think, are really deserved."}, "comment_count": 120, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "play_count": 1027230, "ig_play_count": 1027230, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "video_duration": 81.802001953125, "is_dash_eligible": 1, "video_dash_manifest": "<?xml 